OL,3,GNEWSALeicester Pride brings colour to
OL,4,Acity streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual Leicester Pride celebration
OL,7,Freturned to the city on Saturday.
OL,9,FThe event, which is free to attend, saw
OL,10,Fpeople getting together outside The
OL,11,FCurve Theatre at 12:00 BST for a parade
OL,12,Faround the city on a 2.8km (1.7 mile)
OL,13,Froute.
OL,15,FThe charity behind the occasion said
OL,16,Flive singers, dance acts, and cabaret
OL,17,Ffrom across the country would take to
OL,18,Fthe main stage at Abbey Park from 13:00
OL,19,FBST to 21:00.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
